ALVA — Settings grammar and capitalization overhaul

Objective

Review and polish the entire Settings interface in the Alva game.

The goal is to make every heading, option, button, description, and label grammatically correct, professionally written, and consistently capitalized.

Use sentence case throughout Settings, rather than title case or all-uppercase formatting.

Examples:

* CONTROLS → Controls
* LANGUAGE → Language
* COMBAT → Combat
* Mobile Controls → Mobile controls
* Classic Buttons → Classic buttons
* Combat Assist → Combat assist
* DEFAULT → Default
* CUSTOM LAYOUT → Custom layout
* SIZE → Size

Apply this consistently across the entire Settings experience, not just these examples.

